msgid "Grab the audio from your CD-ROMs"
msgstr "Izdvojite zvuk s CD-ROM-ova"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.audex.appdata.xml:9
msgid "Audex is a CD ripper application. It lets you extract the audio from your CDs to let you listen to them on your computer and your other devices. It includes CDDB and MusicBrainz integrations to fetch the metadata and covers for your CDs if available."
msgstr "Audex je aplikacija za izdvajanje zvučnih zapisa s CD-ova. Omogućuje izdvajanje zvuka s CD-ova kako biste ga mogli slušati na računalu i drugim uređajima. Sadrži integraciju s bazama CDDB i MusicBrainz za dohvat metapodataka i naslovnica CD-ova, ako su dostupni."

